        <mxCell id="transitions" value="ACT-295-01 Search icons toggle only their own field; opening focuses it. Closing/Escape clears the hidden query and restores all records; Escape returns focus to the icon. Clear empties the query while keeping the input open.&#10;ACT-295-02 Changing agent/turn scope resets search and collapses fields; searches and exports preserve existing matching/order/scope.&#10;ACT-295-03 Zero telemetry uses plain centered text; filtered-to-zero uses truthful no-match text. Populated records retain their current disclosure cards. No shimmer or fake loading state. Viewing/searching never invokes a model." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#18181b;strokeColor=#3f3f46;fontColor=#e4e4e7;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
